# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
# Any path that does not match a real file (so /pl/, /ru/, /ua/, /en/, /by/,
# plus any unknown URL) gets index.html with a 200 status. This replaces the
# GitHub Pages 404.html workaround with a clean 200, which is what Google
# wants for the per-language routes the SPA reads on boot.
#
# GitHub Pages ignores this file. Cloudflare Pages parses it and applies the
# rules during request handling.
/*  /index.html  200
